@flexiarg operator/ask-for-the-working-demo
@title Ask To See The Work Running, Not A Description Of It
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-AGhASK turn-blG3JA; first proposed for: Missions are reported as progressing but Joe has seen no evidence they work.
@why [stack-coherence/evidence-ledger]

! conclusion: ask to see actual demos of the named work working

  + IF:
    a claim of progress has no concrete artifact Joe can look at

  + HOWEVER:
    asking for 'status' gets more description

  + THEN:
    ask to see actual demos of the named work working

  + BECAUSE:
    a running demo is the artifact the ledger would otherwise have to find
